# Optional: copy to apps/api/.dev.vars for model-backed parsing. Without any slot, Pace offers
# English and Russian rule-based previews.
#
# Numbered slots, asked in order: LLM_BASE_URL_N, LLM_API_KEY_N and LLM_MODEL_N go together, any N.
# A slot may list several models (each its own priority) and several keys (comma separated).
# A model that has not started answering within 5 s, or fails, gets the next one asked in parallel;
# the first valid answer wins. Every endpoint must be OpenAI-compatible with JSON-schema output.
#
# LLM_BASE_URL_1=https://provider.example/v1
# LLM_API_KEY_1=key-one,key-two
# LLM_MODEL_1=reader-large,reader-small
#
# LLM_BASE_URL_2=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai
# LLM_API_KEY_2=gemini-key
# LLM_MODEL_2=gemini-flash-latest
#
# LLM_BASE_URL_3=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# LLM_API_KEY_3=groq-key
# LLM_MODEL_3=openai/gpt-oss-120b
